  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GPN Advisory services-UNDP-HQ-00127443</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is established to enhance the quality, integration and strategic value of UNDP interventions across all themes underpinning the six signature solutions, through the provision of evidence-based integrated policy advice tailored to country level needs. This Engagement Facility aims to (1) roll-out robust GPN technical accompaniment solutions, to meet high quality standards for project design and implementation of all sources of funding including FWs, and to also (2) strengthen quality</narrative>
  </description>
